<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="153144011"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:41.200"><div begin="24.470" end="49.424" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="24.470" end="30.564" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.470" end="25.396">如果</span><span begin="25.396" end="26.222">我有</span><span begin="26.222" end="27.053">一双</span><span begin="27.053" end="28.275">翅</span><span begin="28.275" end="30.564">膀</span></p><p begin="31.030" end="37.350" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.030" end="32.004">我要</span><span begin="32.004" end="32.834">离开</span><span begin="32.834" end="33.677">这个</span><span begin="33.677" end="34.880">地</span><span begin="34.880" end="37.350">方</span></p><p begin="37.360" end="43.947" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.360" end="37.818">我</span><span begin="37.818" end="38.661">奋力</span><span begin="38.661" end="39.492">一掷</span> <span begin="39.492" end="40.275">我就</span><span begin="40.275" end="40.963">飞</span><span begin="40.963" end="41.567">到</span><span begin="41.567" end="42.019">了</span><span begin="42.019" end="42.551">云</span><span begin="42.551" end="43.947">端</span></p><p begin="44.430" end="49.424" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.430" end="45.292">可以</span><span begin="45.292" end="46.155">靠近</span><span begin="46.155" end="47.002">点月</span><span begin="47.002" end="49.424">亮</span></p></div><div begin="51.040" end="1:16.049" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="51.040" end="57.227" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.040" end="51.949">当我</span><span begin="51.949" end="52.773">离开</span><span begin="52.773" end="53.673">这个</span><span begin="53.673" end="54.904">地</span><span begin="54.904" end="57.227">方</span></p><p begin="57.770" end="1:03.976" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.770" end="58.651">不会</span><span begin="58.651" end="59.456">再有</span><span begin="59.456" end="1:00.318">痛苦</span><span begin="1:00.318" end="1:01.520">哀</span><span begin="1:01.520" end="1:03.976">伤</span></p><p begin="1:04.390" end="1:10.776" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.390" end="1:05.302">风儿</span><span begin="1:05.302" end="1:06.114">总把</span><span begin="1:06.114" end="1:06.985">沙子</span><span begin="1:06.985" end="1:07.619">吹</span><span begin="1:07.619" end="1:08.247">向</span><span begin="1:08.247" end="1:08.669">了</span><span begin="1:08.669" end="1:09.244">远</span><span begin="1:09.244" end="1:10.776">方</span></p><p begin="1:11.140" end="1:16.049" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.140" end="1:11.988">跟我</span><span begin="1:11.988" end="1:12.805">一样</span><span begin="1:12.805" end="1:13.663">的愿</span><span begin="1:13.663" end="1:16.049">望</span></p></div><div begin="1:19.280" end="1:44.232" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:19.280" end="1:25.947" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.280" end="1:20.238">慢慢</span><span begin="1:20.238" end="1:22.320">的</span><span begin="1:22.320" end="1:23.155">当我</span><span begin="1:23.155" end="1:23.561">发</span><span begin="1:23.561" end="1:25.947">现</span></p><p begin="1:26.100" end="1:32.353" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.100" end="1:26.973">已经</span><span begin="1:26.973" end="1:27.788">忘</span><span begin="1:27.788" end="1:29.527">记</span><span begin="1:29.527" end="1:30.384">你的</span><span begin="1:30.384" end="1:32.353">脸</span></p><p begin="1:32.750" end="1:39.188" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.750" end="1:33.675">慢慢</span><span begin="1:33.675" end="1:35.726">的</span><span begin="1:35.726" end="1:36.525">我就</span><span begin="1:36.525" end="1:36.971">出</span><span begin="1:36.971" end="1:39.188">现</span></p><p begin="1:39.400" end="1:44.232" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.400" end="1:40.285">无可</span><span begin="1:40.285" end="1:41.139">所</span><span begin="1:41.139" end="1:42.803">谓</span><span begin="1:42.803" end="1:43.582">容</span><span begin="1:43.582" end="1:44.232">颜</span></p><